cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Creuset or its published measurements, please cite it as below."
title: Creuset
abstract: >-
  Creuset is an adversarial security gate for tool-calling AI agents: it runs an
  agent against a library of attack cases in an isolated Docker sandbox, scores
  the transcripts with deterministic rules plus an LLM judge, and only promotes a
  candidate whose results pass severity thresholds.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Jackson
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/jackson-gits/creuset"
keywords:
  - llm-security
  - ai-agents
  - prompt-injection
  - red-teaming
  - devsecops
